@startuml
!theme plain
|a_team| Campaign Team
|a_dept| Department
|a_cust| Customer
|a_party| Relevant Party
|a_team|
start
:start the process by receiving the contract for the marketing campaign;
|a_dept|
:take the contract to the department;
|a_team|
:input the customer's details into NKE;
:are the customer's details ready;
:v1: are the customer's details ready ({Missing, Ready}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Missing'])
|a_cust|
:contact the customers to get missing details;
:receive additional customer details;
-> after receiving details;
|a_team|
else ([v1 = 'Ready'])
->;
endif
:create a suitable team;
:check previous campaigns for reusable material;
:found reusable ideas from previous campaigns;
:v2: found reusable ideas from previous campaigns ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Yes'])
repeat :create a new concept;
:integrate new ideas and add further points;
:integrate the revised campaign into the database;
|a_party|
:present the concept to the relevant party for consideration;
:was the concept accepted;
:v3: was the concept accepted ({No, Yes}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:rework the concept;
repeat while () is ([v3 = 'No']) not ([v3 = 'Yes'])
|a_cust|
:present the concept to the customer;
|a_team|
stop
else ([v2 = 'No'])
->;
endif
@enduml